NextEcho includes or interoperates with third-party open source components.

Important components referenced by this repository include:

- Flask
- whisper.cpp / whisper-cli
- Whisper model artifacts
- mlx-qwen3-asr (optional Apple Silicon runtime)
- Qwen3-ASR model weights (optional local model artifacts)
- Qwen3.5 model weights via Ollama (optional local model artifacts)
- yt-dlp
- FFmpeg
- pyannote.audio
- sherpa-onnx (optional local diarization runtime)
- Resemblyzer (optional local speaker embedding runtime)
- 3D-Speaker ERes2Net ONNX model (optional local model artifact)
- numpy
- scikit-learn
- Python runtime

